    "slug": "load-balancer-layer-4-routing",
    "title": "Layer 4 Load Balancing",
    "tagline": "Deep technical guide to the architecture, trade-offs, and design mechanics of Layer 4 Load Balancing in distributed environments.",
    "category": "System Design",
    "readTime": 10,
